  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-005 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir. This quality release adds post-pick splash illustrations, full-body encyclopedia portraits, image-generated Baron Nashor, elemental-drake, neutral-monster, defensive-tower, and League-style item art, plus locally extracted official Baron audio. Six elemental-drake art variants are packaged; the supported runtime currently uses Infernal Drake because the public mod SDK exposes no replay-safe per-spawn objective swap. The native DLL is rebuilt for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
